---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact — Zeus DeLaCruz" description="Get in touch — consulting, coaching, speaking, and system building inquiries.">
<!-- Contact v2 | /contact/ -->
<section class="hero-full" style="min-height:auto;padding:3rem 0 2rem;">
  <div class="hero-badge">REACH OUT</div>
  <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem;">Let's <span style="color:var(--accent-bright);">build something.</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub" style="font-size:1.15rem;max-width:600px;">Start with a 15-minute discovery call. Free. No pitch. We figure out what you actually need.</p>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">What to Expect</h2>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;">
      <h4>1. You fill out the form →</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Name, email, what you're building, what you need. 60 seconds.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;">
      <h4>2. I review + respond within 24 hours →</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Either a calendar link for the discovery call, or a quick note if it's not a fit.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;">
      <h4>3. 15-minute call →</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">We scope the problem. I tell you what's possible, what it costs, how long it takes. No commitment. No pressure.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;">
      <h4>4. Proposal or referral →</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">If I can help, you get a fixed-scope proposal within 48 hours. If I can't, I'll point you to someone who can.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center;">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The Form</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">⚠️ Zoho form embed goes here — fields: Name, Email, What are you building?, What do you need?, How did you find me?</p>
  <a href="#" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;">⚠️ Submit (form pending)</a>
</section>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;">
  <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Prefer direct? Email me or DM on X. Links in the footer.</p>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
